# Cross-origin isolation, required for SharedArrayBuffer so the Blazor engine (built with
# WasmEnableThreads) can run Roslyn work on background WASM threads instead of blocking the
# UI thread. Recognized by Netlify/Cloudflare Pages; other static hosts need the equivalent
# configured through their own mechanism (e.g. an nginx/CDN header rule).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
